1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,465
Restaurant Guide keeps restaurant information, ratings, photos and visit notes together, helping you

2
00:00:06,465 --> 00:00:11,089
remember what you ate and whether you would order it again.

3
00:00:11,089 --> 00:00:14,031
The purple Splash Screen introduces the application.

4
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:20,860
The Restaurant List uses scrollable cards with a photo, name and rating.

5
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:26,089
Rounded corners, soft borders and purple headings make the saved restaurants easy to

6
00:00:26,089 --> 00:00:26,491
scan.

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,278
Search restaurants updates results as you type.

8
00:00:31,278 --> 00:00:34,454
Select multiple tags, or All to reset them.

9
00:00:34,454 --> 00:00:39,217
No restaurants found provides a way to clear the search and filters.

10
00:00:58,068 --> 00:01:04,549
Restaurant Details shows the selected cover, rating, description, read-only tags, photos and contact

11
00:01:04,549 --> 00:01:05,047
information.

12
00:01:05,047 --> 00:01:10,531
Back returns to the list while preserving search and selected filters.

13
00:01:12,535 --> 00:01:18,371
My photos opens a larger gallery with captions, swiping, arrows and thumbnails.

14
00:01:18,371 --> 00:01:20,317
Zoom allows closer inspection.

15
00:01:20,317 --> 00:01:25,668
Each caption describes one photo; visit notes describe the restaurant visit.

16
00:01:38,281 --> 00:01:42,114
Edit visit notes opens a draft for the selected restaurant.

17
00:01:42,114 --> 00:01:44,798
Cancel discards it, and Save applies it.

18
00:01:44,798 --> 00:01:48,631
The rounded lavender Notes panel keeps the saved note readable.

19
00:01:55,247 --> 00:02:00,801
View full map shows the selected static Map preview and saved address.

20
00:02:00,801 --> 00:02:05,892
Back returns to Details; Get directions prepares an external destination URL.

21
00:02:05,892 --> 00:02:08,206
Live location remains future work.

22
00:02:10,214 --> 00:02:16,187
Share by email prepares name, address, phone numbers, rating, tags and description.

23
00:02:16,187 --> 00:02:22,658
Without an email app, Email app unavailable shows a copyable fallback containing the

24
00:02:22,658 --> 00:02:23,654
restaurant details.

25
00:02:32,814 --> 00:02:36,204
Add restaurant reuses rounded fields and clear labels.

26
00:02:36,204 --> 00:02:39,595
Saving without a name displays Restaurant name required.

27
00:02:39,595 --> 00:02:43,409
After Got it, enter the name and other details.

28
00:03:07,522 --> 00:03:10,361
Slide across enlarged stars in half-star steps.

29
00:03:10,361 --> 00:03:14,417
Rating Cancel discards the selection; rating Save updates the draft.

30
00:03:14,417 --> 00:03:19,283
Add tag creates a custom tag before the full form is saved.

31
00:03:45,656 --> 00:03:47,859
Edit pre-fills the saved record.

32
00:03:47,859 --> 00:03:50,502
Back discards changes; Save updates it.

33
00:03:50,502 --> 00:03:56,229
Delete asks for confirmation: Cancel keeps the record, while Delete removes it from

34
00:03:56,229 --> 00:03:57,551
the current session.

35
00:04:41,461 --> 00:04:47,988
About identifies Restaurant Guide, COMP3074, Team P12 and all four team members.

36
00:04:47,988 --> 00:04:51,795
This interactive UI prototype uses session data.

37
00:04:51,795 --> 00:04:57,234
Permanent storage, live maps and location permissions remain future work.
